    { "key": "notice.restart", "en": "It couldn't start on this headset. Restart the headset (hold the power button, then Restart) and open Word World again.\nUntil then, practice objects let you keep learning.", "zh": "物品识别无法在这台头显上启动。请重启头显（长按电源键，选择重启），然后重新打开单词世界。\n在此之前，可以用练习物品继续学习。" },
    { "key": "notice.permission", "en": "Word World needs camera access to recognise objects. Allow it in the headset's Settings, then open Word World again.\nUntil then, practice objects let you keep learning.", "zh": "单词世界需要摄像头权限来识别物品。请在头显设置中允许，然后重新打开单词世界。\n在此之前，可以用练习物品继续学习。" },
